      <h1 class="ed-title">Treadmill Rental and Rent-to-Own</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Renting a treadmill is a sensible answer to a short, defined need. Rent-to-own is usually the most expensive way there is to end up owning one. Here is the arithmetic, and the cheaper route most people overlook.
      </p>

      <!-- Byline -->
      <div class="ed-byline">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
